            <title>[LU-13286] LNet selftest works well on MR nodes only if primary NIDs are specified </title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-13286</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It has been observed that in a scenario where LNet selftest is run between MR nodes with multiple NIs, the test works properly only if respective primary NIDs are configured to be used by the selftest script.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
